id: resilient-demon-lord
name: Resilient Demon Lord
order: 2
optionOf: heart-of-evil
description: >
  Resilient Demon Lord [Triggered]: If you are targeted by an Attacking Maneuver from an Opponent with a Combat Condition, increase your Soak Value and Damage Reduction by 1(T) for the duration of that Attacking Maneuver.
text: >
  Resilient Demon Lord [Triggered]: If you are targeted by an Attacking Maneuver from an Opponent with a Combat Condition, increase your Soak Value and Damage Reduction by 1(T) for the duration of that Attacking Maneuver.

---

[passive]
# Against the attack of one suffering from a Combat Condition - Demonic Combat (2)'s Damage Reduction, and its Soak (chat.mjs).
damageReduction.vsConditioned += 1(T);
allow resilientDemon.soak;
